  "description": "🍂☕ Embrace the warmth of the season with this cozy fall watercolor clipart collection featuring comforting autumn essentials, delicious treats, woodland accents, and inviting home décor. Created in a modern commercial watercolor style with simplified organic shapes, soft painterly textures, and warm autumn colors, every illustration captures the peaceful feeling of crisp mornings, homemade desserts, hot drinks, and cozy evenings without a vintage or rustic look.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on Demand products\n• Stickers and sticker sheets\n• Scrapbooking projects\n• Journals and planners\n• Greeting cards and bookmarks\n• Invitations and stationery\n• Social media graphics\n• Seasonal home décor designs\n• Digital and printable crafts\n• Cozy autumn and fall projects\n🧡 What’s included:\n– 20 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 20 SVG files\n🍁 Included illustrations:\namber glass candle, wicker picnic basket, homemade bread on a wooden board, honey jar with dipper, ceramic mixing bowl with batter, maple leaf wreath, plaid wool scarf, baked pears, autumn baking book, vintage lantern, campfire, cozy reading chair, toasted marshmallow, s’more, tea bags, sleeping fox, hot cocoa with marshmallows, woodland mushrooms, pumpkin pie slice, insulated thermos with hot tea etc.\n🍂 Inspired by cozy autumn mornings, warm blankets, seasonal baking, woodland walks, pumpkin season, slow living, hot tea, homemade treats, fall picnics, forest cabins, comforting home décor, crisp evenings, campfires, and peaceful reading moments. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, inviting seasonal designs with a modern cozy autumn aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>🍂☕ Embrace the warmth of the season with this cozy fall watercolor clipart collection featuring comforting autumn essentials, delicious treats, woodland accents, and inviting home décor. Created in a modern commercial watercolor style with simplified organic shapes, soft painterly textures, and warm autumn colors, every illustration captures the peaceful feeling of crisp mornings, homemade desserts, hot drinks, and cozy evenings without a vintage or rustic look.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:</p>\n<p>• Print on Demand products<br>\n• Stickers and sticker sheets<br>\n• Scrapbooking projects<br>\n• Journals and planners<br>\n• Greeting cards and bookmarks<br>\n• Invitations and stationery<br>\n• Social media graphics<br>\n• Seasonal home décor designs<br>\n• Digital and printable crafts<br>\n• Cozy autumn and fall projects</p>\n<p>🧡 What’s included:</p>\n<p>– 20 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 20 SVG files</p>\n<p>🍁 Included illustrations:<br>\namber glass candle, wicker picnic basket, homemade bread on a wooden board, honey jar with dipper, ceramic mixing bowl with batter, maple leaf wreath, plaid wool scarf, baked pears, autumn baking book, vintage lantern, campfire, cozy reading chair, toasted marshmallow, s’more, tea bags, sleeping fox, hot cocoa with marshmallows, woodland mushrooms, pumpkin pie slice, insulated thermos with hot tea etc.</p>\n<p>🍂 Inspired by cozy autumn mornings, warm blankets, seasonal baking, woodland walks, pumpkin season, slow living, hot tea, homemade treats, fall picnics, forest cabins, comforting home décor, crisp evenings, campfires, and peaceful reading moments. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, inviting seasonal designs with a modern cozy autumn aesthetic.</p>",
